sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caregiver as Caregiver User
    actor Family as Family Client
    participant UI as BookingDetailActivity
    participant VModel as Family / Caregiver ViewModel
    participant BRepo as BookingRepositoryImpl
    participant CRepo as CaregiverRepositoryImpl
    participant UseCase as BillCalculationUseCase
    participant RRepo as ReviewRepositoryImpl
    participant Firestore as Cloud Firestore

    Note over Caregiver, UI: --- Visit Check-In Phase ---
    Caregiver->>UI: Taps 'Check-In' button
    UI->>BRepo: checkInCaregiver(bookingId, currentTime)
    BRepo->>Firestore: update("checkInTimestamp": ts, "status": "IN_PROGRESS")
    Firestore-->>BRepo: Await completion (Success)
    BRepo-->>UI: Resource.Success(Unit)
    Firestore-->>UI: Real-time SnapshotListener emits (Status: IN_PROGRESS)
    UI->>UI: UI updates: Displays Active Session & Check-Out button

    Note over Caregiver, UI: --- Care Service Performed ---
    Caregiver->>Caregiver: Delivers eldercare / companionship service

    Note over Caregiver, UI: --- Visit Check-Out & Billing Phase ---
    Caregiver->>UI: Taps 'Check-Out' button
    UI->>CRepo: getCaregiverProfile(booking.caregiverId)
    CRepo->>Firestore: collection("caregiver_profiles").document(id).get()
    Firestore-->>CRepo: CaregiverProfile document snapshot
    CRepo-->>UI: Resource.Success(profile: hourlyRate = ₹250.0)

    UI->>BRepo: checkOutCaregiver(bookingId, checkInTime, checkOutTime, 250.0)
    activate BRepo
    BRepo->>Firestore: get existing Booking document
    Firestore-->>BRepo: Booking data (checkInTime, etc.)
    BRepo->>UseCase: calculate(checkInTime, checkOutTime, hourlyRate=250.0, fee=50.0)
    activate UseCase
    UseCase-->>BRepo: returns BillDetails(loggedHours=2.5, subtotal=625.0, fee=50.0, total=675.0)
    deactivate UseCase

    BRepo->>Firestore: update(checkOutTimestamp, totalLoggedHours=2.5, status="COMPLETED", bill=BillDto)
    Firestore-->>BRepo: Write successful
    BRepo-->>UI: Resource.Success(updatedBooking)
    deactivate BRepo

    Firestore-->>UI: SnapshotListener emits updated Booking (COMPLETED)
    UI->>UI: Render Itemized Invoice Card (Hours, Subtotal, Platform Fee, Total)

    Note over Family, UI: --- Direct Settlement & Rating Phase ---
    Family->>UI: Inspects Invoice and delivers offline payment
    Family->>UI: Taps 'Mark Settled'
    UI->>BRepo: updateSettlementStatus(bookingId, SETTLED)
    BRepo->>Firestore: update("bill.settlementStatus": "SETTLED")
    Firestore-->>BRepo: Success
    Firestore-->>UI: SnapshotListener emits (settlementStatus: SETTLED)

    Family->>UI: Taps 'Leave Review'
    UI->>UI: Opens LeaveReviewDialog(rating=5.0, comment="Excellent care")
    Family->>UI: Taps 'Submit Review'
    UI->>RRepo: submitReview(review)
    RRepo->>Firestore: collection("reviews").document().set(reviewDto)
    RRepo->>Firestore: update caregiver averageRating & totalReviews
    Firestore-->>RRepo: Success
    RRepo-->>UI: Resource.Success(Unit)
    UI->>Family: Displays 'Thank you for your feedback!' Toast